# Universal Versioning

RULE: ALL repos use semver. GitHub Action bumps version on main merge. Version tag = Docker image tag. NEVER bump version locally on branches. NEVER bump to 1.0.0 until all plan items done and quickmerge passes.
WHY: Local bumps cause double-bumps; Cloud Build idempotent check blocks reuse. workspace-manifest.json is SSOT.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/feature-branch-workflow.md, 06-coding-standards/quality-gates.md

## Bump rules
feat: → minor | fix: → patch | feat!:/BREAKING CHANGE: → major | chore/docs/refactor/test/ci: → none

## DO
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat: X" — CI bumps on merge. After merge: cd unified-trading-pm && git pull to verify manifest.

## NEVER
Edit pyproject.toml version on branch; sed version; docker pull :latest; bump to 1.0.0 before plan complete.

Full workflow, pre-1.0.0 policy, branch builds: CODEX 06-coding-standards/feature-branch-workflow.md
